{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_56_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年，春，公會杞伯姬於洮。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、鄭伯，同盟於幽。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同尊周也。於是而後授之諸侯也。其授之諸侯何也？齊侯得眾也。桓會不致，安之也。桓盟不日，信之也。信其信，仁其仁。衣裳之會十有一，未嘗有歃血之盟也，信厚也。兵車之會四，未嘗有大戰也，愛民也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"三、秋，公子友如陳，葬原仲。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"言葬不言卒，不葬者也。不葬而曰葬，諱出奔也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"四、冬，杞伯姬來。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"五、莒慶來逆叔姬。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"諸侯之嫁子於大夫，主大夫以與之。來者接內也。不正其接內，故不與夫婦之稱也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"六、杞伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_56_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_56","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯於城濮。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}